And, you know, it wasn't really, I didn't mean for the plants to sound presumptuous on approving them with the buffer.

421
00:37:12,000 --> 00:37:17,540
It's just a very tough, as you said, topography site to even develop.

422
00:37:18,160 --> 00:37:25,120
I mean, if you even look at the cover sheet, and you're looking at the areas of this parcel that we're actually developing,

