435
00:38:06,640 --> 00:38:11,660
Trying to maximize what we can put into a piece of property, you know,

436
00:38:11,760 --> 00:38:14,820
while respecting the rules and the boundaries, right?

437
00:38:14,820 --> 00:38:23,800
And, you know, I don't know if this issue was raised before about the wells and the boundary,

438
00:38:23,900 --> 00:38:26,240
but, I mean, it was, you know, raised tonight, obviously, in Steve's letter.

