2077
02:14:27,640 --> 02:14:33,360
We'll put in $30,000, $50,000 towards a million dollars to replace whatever we were replacing.

2078
02:14:33,900 --> 02:14:37,840
We had to have X dollars before the state would kick in their money.

2079
02:14:38,240 --> 02:14:38,560
